Notifications Android API test evidence
Command: ./gradlew :app:testDebugUnitTest :app:assembleDebug --no-daemon
Result: BUILD SUCCESSFUL
Test: PlatformApiNotificationsTest.notificationsBuildsAuthenticatedGetAndParsesChannelAndStatus

The test executes PlatformApi.notifications() against OkHttp MockWebServer and verifies:
GET /api/platform/notifications -> HTTP 200
Authorization: Bearer notification-token
x-tenant-id: tenant-notification
Parsed channel: IN_APP
Parsed status: DELIVERED
Parsed title: Order delivered
The Compose screen renders title, body, channel, and status after the authenticated load.
